Read `.agents/rules/api-backend.md` and `.agents/api-agent.md`.

- Routes in `backend/src/routes/`; Prisma via `backend/src/lib/prisma.ts`.
- Import client from `backend/src/generated/prisma/client.js`.
- Schema changes need `pnpm db:migrate` + `pnpm db:generate`.
- DB URL in `backend/prisma.config.ts`.
